+  `ArenaMap[K, V]` are fixed-capacity, Arena-backed view containers. Their
+  backing storage is allocated once from the supplying `Arena` at
+  construction. They do not own that storage, MUST NOT outlive its Arena
+  region, are `@view` types, and follow `[TYP-15]`. Neither type grows,
+  reallocates, moves its backing buffer, or obtains more Arena storage after
+  construction. This intentionally prevents growth from invalidating element
+  views.
